    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The First Installment of <strong><i>(The Lingering)</i></strong> Series. <strong>Welcome to <i>(The Lingering) Last Customer.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>(The Lingering)</i></strong> is an episodic atmospheric horror series, inspired by <strong>true horror events</strong> and <strong>urban legends in Indonesia</strong>. Each episode tells the unsettling stories of those who cross paths with the lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>(The Lingering) Last Customer</i></strong>, you step into the shoes of <strong>Devi</strong>, a young woman who just worked overtime. Exhausted and desperate for relief, she books a late-night massage at Ahola Spa &amp; Reflexology\u2014the only place that still open. A kind-looking female therapist welcomes her in, giving a much-needed escape Devi desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little did she know the horror lingers inside the massage parlor\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A fixed-cam, narrative-driven, atmospheric horror</i> with a twisting <strong>\u201c<i>Limbo\u201d Puzzle Mechanic</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518780/extras/da6804b02de3b988633cacedb77fcd0e.poster.avif?t=1742817801\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518780/extras/da6804b02de3b988633cacedb77fcd0e.webm?t=1742817801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518780/extras/da6804b02de3b988633cacedb77fcd0e.mp4?t=1742817801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fixed-Camera Perspective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience horror through an immersive <i><strong>fixed-cam</strong></i>, where every angle intensifies the fear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro PSX Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling blend of <i><strong>nostalgic aesthetics</strong></i> and <i><strong>modern horror storytelling</strong></i>, bringing the eerie world to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative-driven Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with the NPC and piece together the <strong>mystery</strong>\u2014but be careful, not all voices lead to salvation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limbo Puzzle Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality bends and distorts as you try to <strong>escape the loop</strong>. Solve environmental puzzles to break free from the lingering horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A True Supernatural Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An eerie, atmospheric horror experience based on true events</strong> set in an <strong>authentic Indonesian</strong> <strong>spa</strong> where tension lingers in every corner.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The First Installment of <strong><i>(The Lingering)</i></strong> Series. <strong>Welcome to <i>(The Lingering) Last Customer.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>(The Lingering)</i></strong> is an episodic atmospheric horror series, inspired by <strong>true horror events</strong> and <strong>urban legends in Indonesia</strong>. Each episode tells the unsettling stories of those who cross paths with the lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>(The Lingering) Last Customer</i></strong>, you step into the shoes of <strong>Devi</strong>, a young woman who just worked overtime. Exhausted and desperate for relief, she books a late-night massage at Ahola Spa &amp; Reflexology\u2014the only place that still open. A kind-looking female therapist welcomes her in, giving a much-needed escape Devi desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little did she know the horror lingers inside the massage parlor\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A fixed-cam, narrative-driven, atmospheric horror</i> with a twisting <strong>\u201c<i>Limbo\u201d Puzzle Mechanic</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518780/extras/da6804b02de3b988633cacedb77fcd0e.poster.avif?t=1742817801\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518780/extras/da6804b02de3b988633cacedb77fcd0e.webm?t=1742817801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518780/extras/da6804b02de3b988633cacedb77fcd0e.mp4?t=1742817801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fixed-Camera Perspective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience horror through an immersive <i><strong>fixed-cam</strong></i>, where every angle intensifies the fear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro PSX Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling blend of <i><strong>nostalgic aesthetics</strong></i> and <i><strong>modern horror storytelling</strong></i>, bringing the eerie world to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative-driven Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with the NPC and piece together the <strong>mystery</strong>\u2014but be careful, not all voices lead to salvation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limbo Puzzle Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality bends and distorts as you try to <strong>escape the loop</strong>. Solve environmental puzzles to break free from the lingering horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A True Supernatural Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An eerie, atmospheric horror experience based on true events</strong> set in an <strong>authentic Indonesian</strong> <strong>spa</strong> where tension lingers in every corner.</p>",
